#: ../../source/qqqr/base.rst:2
msgid "QQQR Bases"
msgstr "QQQR 基类"

#: of qqqr.base:1
msgid "Base classes for all QQQR login flows."
msgstr "所有 QQQR 登录流程的基类。"

#: of qqqr.base:3
msgid ""
"Defines :class:`LoginSession` (data container) and :class:`LoginBase` (login procedure). All "
"``xxLogin`` and ``xxSession`` classes inherit from these."
msgstr "定义了 :class:`LoginSession`（数据容器）和 :class:`LoginBase`（登录流程）。所有 ``xxLogin`` 和 ``xxSession`` 类都继承自它们。"

#: of qqqr.base.LoginSession:1
msgid "A LoginSession collects all data generated or received during login."
msgstr "LoginSession 收集登录过程中生成或接收的所有数据。"

#: ../../../docstring of qqqr.base.LoginSession.login_url:1
msgid "GET this login url to get cookies."
msgstr "GET 此登录 URL 以获取 cookies。"

#: ../../../docstring of qqqr.base.LoginSession.logined:1
msgid "whether this session is logined."
msgstr "此 session 是否已登录。"

#: of qqqr.base.LoginBase:1
msgid "Base class for login procedures."
msgstr "登录流程的基类。"

#: of qqqr.base.LoginBase:3
msgid ""
"Handles common login setup: client configuration, user-agent selection, login page URL "
"construction, and cookie retrieval. Subclasses implement :meth:`new` and :meth:`login` for "
"specific login flows."
msgstr "处理通用登录设置：客户端配置、User-Agent 选择、登录页面 URL 构建和 cookie 获取。子类实现 :meth:`new` 和 :meth:`login` 以支持特定的登录流程。"

#: of qqqr.base.LoginBase.deviceId:1
msgid "a js fingerprint. :rtype: :sphinx_autodoc_typehints_type:`\\:py\\:class\\:\\`str\\``"
msgstr ""

#: of qqqr.base.LoginBase.deviceId:5
msgid "https://github.com/fingerprintjs/fingerprintjs"
msgstr ""

#: of qqqr.base.LoginBase.login_page_url:1
msgid "Build the xlogin page URL with configured parameters."
msgstr "使用配置的参数构建 xlogin 页面 URL。"

#: of qqqr.base.LoginBase.login_page_url:3
msgid "Includes appid, daid, proxy URLs, and optional app info."
msgstr "包含 appid、daid、代理 URL 和可选的 app 信息。"

#: of qqqr.base.LoginBase.login:1
msgid "Block until login cookie is received."
msgstr "阻塞直到获取到登录 cookie。"

#: of qqqr.base.LoginBase.login:3
msgid ""
"The implementation should handle the full login flow: creating a session, checking status, "
"solving captcha if needed, and returning the cookie dict."
msgstr "实现应处理完整的登录流程：创建 session、检查状态、必要时解决验证码、返回 cookie 字典。"

